    "_spec": "Split frames: the title zone sits over the short column only, and the tall column runs the full body height from y 36, up through the header band, to the body bottom. Columns are 12-column spans with the standard 18 pt gutter. Use for content that needs height: a 2x2, a tall diagram, a full-height photo or table. Combine with no rail or the nav rail.",
